 I. Using MediaDevices Navigator:
This approach uses the `MediaDevices` navigator to interact with the user's media devices, such as a camera or microphone.

Method 1 - Open Camera:
```javascript
async function openCamera() {
  try {
    const stream = await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({ video: true });
    // Use the stream for your webcam application here
  } catch (err) {
    console.error('Error opening camera:', err);
